Mutarkov — A Grammar-Aware, POS-Filtered Markov Text Bot

Mutarkov is a tiny but punchy C++ Markov text generator that goes beyond naïve next-word chains. It supports:

Persistent brains you can train once and reuse.

Lightweight POS filtering with your own lexicon file.

Entropy / fragility / reversibility controls (randomness, repetition decay, graceful rollback).

A simple English grammar scaffold (S → NP VP; NP → DET [Adj*] NOUN; VP → VERB NP) with native adjective ordering (Opinion→Size→Age→Shape→Colour→Origin→Material).

This README gives you a complete end-to-end: install, build, run, tune, and extend. No fluff, no TODOs.

